  "commit_message": "Port review launcher to Python\n\nAdd the canonical python3 python/cli.py agent launch-review verb for Codex and Cursor review runs, including prompt sidecars, retry metadata, token-budget handling, timing, diagnostics, dirty-tree sidecars, and vendor usage records.\n\nRetarget dispatch, scouting, voting, and collector retry callers to the Python launcher, fail closed on retired review shell metadata, and retire the shell launcher plus its shell harness.\n\nAdd pytest parity coverage for the Python review launcher and update active docs, rules, security notes, lint allowlists, and the migrated-scripts manifest.\n\nInline-triage rule 1: Corrected stale cursor empty-result retry bound while updating launcher docs.",
